  "prefLabel": "Liq 705.42 Sports Entertainment Complex",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 705.42 Sports Entertainment Complex. Applicants for a sports entertainment complex license shall complete and submit Form LTW-43, “License Type Worksheet-Sports Entertainment Complex” (revised 8/2020) providing all required information, acknowledgments, and attach a copy of the applicant’s contract for operating under this license if the applicant is not the owner of the complex.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
